553
00:33:15,860 --> 00:33:17,620
can be discharged?

554
00:33:17,710 --> 00:33:18,760
I'm not sure.

555
00:33:18,890 --> 00:33:20,570
Please ask the doctor yourself later.

556
00:33:24,700 --> 00:33:26,550
Okay. I'll ask the doctor.

557
00:33:29,060 --> 00:33:29,810
Is this okay?

558
00:33:30,510 --> 00:33:33,460
I don't know anything. You can arrange it.

559
00:33:33,550 --> 00:33:34,910
Is it too much?

560
00:34:25,290 --> 00:34:25,989
How did it go?

561
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:27,050
Did you see anything this time?

562
00:34:29,250 --> 00:34:29,949
No.

563
00:34:30,699 --> 00:34:32,060
No matter how hard I tried,

564
00:34:32,239 --> 00:34:34,480
no matter how much I wanted to see
what happened before,

565
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,679
I couldn't see anything

566
00:34:37,739 --> 00:34:38,880
aside from that house.

567
00:34:39,409 --> 00:34:40,860
Okay, to sum it up,

568
00:34:41,480 --> 00:34:43,590
after you appeared at the house,

569
00:34:43,860 --> 00:34:45,880
the very first time you saw
the Reflection of Time

570
00:34:46,409 --> 00:34:48,170
was the car accident Tien-ti was in
when she was little.

571
00:34:50,630 --> 00:34:51,690
Could it be like this?

572
00:34:51,820 --> 00:34:53,449
Before the car accident,

573
00:34:53,620 --> 00:34:55,250
Kakarayan hadn't given you
the Reflection of Time.

574
00:34:55,340 --> 00:34:56,400
That was why you couldn't see anything.

575
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:57,280
No way.

576
00:34:58,070 --> 00:34:59,560
For thousands of years,

577
00:34:59,650 --> 00:35:00,970
I've been carrying out work

578
00:35:01,100 --> 00:35:01,850
according to the Reflection of Time
that He showed me.

579
00:35:02,330 --> 00:35:04,010
How else would I know where I was going

580
00:35:04,180 --> 00:35:06,120
or which Kawas I would be naming?

581
00:35:06,210 --> 00:35:07,040
And how else would I know

582
00:35:07,130 --> 00:35:08,850
when I was supposed
to bless or curse the world?

583
00:35:10,390 --> 00:35:11,530
You're right.

584
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:12,810
It also doesn't explain

585
00:35:12,940 --> 00:35:15,530
why you have memories
from before the car accident,

586
00:35:16,110 --> 00:35:16,720
but you can't see

587
00:35:16,810 --> 00:35:18,570
the Reflection of Time
from before the car accident.

588
00:35:20,070 --> 00:35:21,740
This is so weird.

589
00:35:22,130 --> 00:35:25,740
You said before I woke up yesterday,

590
00:35:26,450 --> 00:35:27,850
you saw Fali holding the Comb of Memories

591
00:35:27,940 --> 00:35:28,910
before me.

592
00:35:29,350 --> 00:35:31,420
Yes, when we were
in the Reflection of Time,

593
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:32,910
I heard his voice too.

594
00:35:33,180 --> 00:35:37,710
[The things that I dreamed of]

595
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:40,750
[will become the paths you take.]

596
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,980
Do you hear a strange voice?

597
00:35:42,070 --> 00:35:44,050
It sounds like Fali.

598
00:35:47,210 --> 00:35:48,180
Let's go. This place is scary.

599
00:35:48,270 --> 00:35:49,680
Come on, let's go.

600
00:35:49,810 --> 00:35:50,600
You looked like

601
00:35:50,690 --> 00:35:53,110
your memory was being erased.

602
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:54,470
Your expression and eyes were dead.

603
00:35:54,560 --> 00:35:55,880
I kept calling you, but you didn't answer.

604
00:35:55,970 --> 00:35:57,640
You freaked me out.

605
00:35:58,960 --> 00:35:59,750
What's wrong?

606
00:36:00,590 --> 00:36:02,170
Does that mean

607
00:36:02,350 --> 00:36:03,230
I can only remember

608
00:36:03,320 --> 00:36:05,120
what happened before the car accident

609
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:06,440
but can't see

610
00:36:06,530 --> 00:36:08,420
its Reflection of Time

611
00:36:08,900 --> 00:36:10,090
because all the Reflection of Time

612
00:36:10,180 --> 00:36:10,930
that I saw after the car accident

613
00:36:11,020 --> 00:36:12,600
was what Fali had wanted me to see?

614
00:36:13,390 --> 00:36:15,060
Because everything I saw after that

615
00:36:15,500 --> 00:36:17,750
and the records in your wife's notebook

616
00:36:18,500 --> 00:36:19,860
all happened

617
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:22,540
after the car accident took place.

618
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:26,940
Okay, if that hypothesis is correct,

619
00:36:27,340 --> 00:36:29,720
that means from that point onward,

620
00:36:30,550 --> 00:36:31,870
the things you saw of the future,

621
00:36:32,090 --> 00:36:34,120
like how you'd fall in love with Tien-ti,

622
00:36:34,510 --> 00:36:36,230
were all part of Fali's plan.

623
00:36:39,750 --> 00:36:41,200
I fell for Tien-ti

624
00:36:43,930 --> 00:36:45,470
because he wanted me to?

625
00:36:45,600 --> 00:36:47,710
No, it's just an assumption.

626
00:36:48,280 --> 00:36:49,870
If you want to test
whether the Reflections of Time you saw

627
00:36:49,960 --> 00:36:51,190
are true or not,

628
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,420
there's only one thing to do.

629
00:36:53,080 --> 00:36:54,840
It's to find the real Reflection of Time.

630
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:55,940
And see

631
00:36:56,250 --> 00:36:58,180
if we can find anything from it.

632
00:36:58,620 --> 00:36:59,860
But I can't see anything now.

633
00:36:59,940 --> 00:37:00,560
Other than me,

634
00:37:00,650 --> 00:37:02,320
no one else can see
the Reflection of Time.

635
00:37:02,890 --> 00:37:03,950
Says who?

636
00:37:04,690 --> 00:37:05,350
Who else?

637
00:37:05,930 --> 00:37:06,810
Have you forgotten?

638
00:37:07,290 --> 00:37:09,140
After all the Kawas left

639
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:11,910
and you lost your powers as the messenger,

640
00:37:12,220 --> 00:37:13,270
there was one person

641
00:37:13,450 --> 00:37:15,740
who tried to help you reconnect
with Kakarayan.

642
00:37:16,090 --> 00:37:17,150
Then by accident,

643
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,950
she saw the Reflection of Time
that hadn't happened

644
00:37:19,170 --> 00:37:20,580
and found me.

645
00:37:51,160 --> 00:37:53,800
So you're just going to let it be

646
00:37:53,890 --> 00:37:55,560
and do nothing?

647
00:37:57,410 --> 00:37:58,640
But you have the ability

648
00:37:58,730 --> 00:38:00,310
to change everything,

649
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:01,320
don't you?

650
00:38:03,790 --> 00:38:04,360
Yes.

651
00:38:07,700 --> 00:38:09,420
It's because I'm almighty,

652
00:38:10,820 --> 00:38:12,230
I'm powerless.

653
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:40,040
Since I'm powerless,

654
00:38:42,330 --> 00:38:43,820
I'm giving you my blessing.

655
00:38:59,400 --> 00:39:01,160
Why should you live?

656
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,640
Why you?

657
00:39:06,570 --> 00:39:07,230
Why you?

658
00:39:25,180 --> 00:39:26,190
Why you?
